msgid "Bank"
msgstr "Bank"

#: apps/uploads/importers/__init__.py:25
msgid "Reconcile the bank accounts with the statements from internet banking."
msgstr "Rekonsiliasi rekening bank dengan rekening koran dari internet banking."

#: apps/uploads/importers/bank.py:26
msgid "Bank account"
msgstr "Rekening bank"

#: apps/uploads/importers/bank.py:38
msgid ""
"The account statement downloaded from internet banking (CSV or XLSX): date, description, and the "
"amount in debit and credit columns or in one column marked DB/CR. Lines uploaded before are "
"skipped; each new one is reconciled with the entry in the books that has the same amount within "
"five days, if there is exactly one."
msgstr ""
"Rekening koran yang diunduh dari internet banking (CSV atau XLSX): tanggal, keterangan, dan jumlah"
" pada kolom debet dan kredit atau pada satu kolom bertanda DB/CR. Baris yang sudah pernah diunggah"
" dilewati; setiap baris baru direkonsiliasi dengan jurnal di pembukuan yang jumlahnya sama dalam "
"lima hari, bila hanya ada satu."

#: apps/uploads/importers/bank.py:66
msgid "The file has no amount: it needs debit and credit columns, or an amount column."
msgstr "Berkas tidak memiliki jumlah: perlu kolom debet dan kredit, atau kolom jumlah."

#: apps/uploads/importers/bank.py:75
msgid "Enter the amount in either the debit or the credit column."
msgstr "Isi jumlah pada kolom debet atau kolom kredit saja."

#: apps/uploads/importers/bank.py:86
msgid "The line has no amount."
msgstr "Baris tidak memiliki jumlah."

#: apps/uploads/importers/bank.py:92
#, python-format
msgid "DB/CR: %(value)s is neither."
msgstr "DB/CR: %(value)s bukan keduanya."

#: apps/uploads/importers/bank.py:109
msgid "Uploaded before."
msgstr "Sudah pernah diunggah."

#: apps/uploads/importers/bank.py:113
#, python-format
msgid "Reconciled with %(entry)s."
msgstr "Direkonsiliasi dengan %(entry)s."

#: apps/uploads/importers/bank.py:114
msgid "To reconcile."
msgstr "Perlu direkonsiliasi."

#: apps/uploads/importers/base.py:105
#, python-format
msgid "The file has no column %(column)s."
msgstr "Berkas tidak memiliki kolom %(column)s."

#: apps/uploads/importers/base.py:120
msgid "The database refused this row."
msgstr "Basis data menolak baris ini."

#: apps/uploads/importers/base.py:141
#, python-format
msgid "%(column)s: %(value)s is not an amount."
msgstr "%(column)s: %(value)s bukan jumlah uang."

#: apps/uploads/importers/base.py:143
#, python-format
msgid "%(column)s: enter an amount."
msgstr "%(column)s: isi jumlahnya."

#: apps/uploads/importers/base.py:151
#, python-format
msgid "%(column)s: %(value)s is not a date (use DD/MM/YYYY)."
msgstr "%(column)s: %(value)s bukan tanggal (gunakan HH/BB/TTTT)."

#: apps/uploads/importers/base.py:153
#, python-format
msgid "%(column)s: enter a date."
msgstr "%(column)s: isi tanggalnya."

#: apps/uploads/importers/base.py:161
#, python-format
msgid "%(column)s: write yes or no."
msgstr "%(column)s: tulis ya atau tidak."

#: apps/uploads/importers/base.py:170
#, python-format
msgid "%(column)s: %(value)s is not one of the choices."
msgstr "%(column)s: %(value)s bukan salah satu pilihan."

#: apps/uploads/importers/base.py:197
msgid "The file couldn't be checked. Try again."
msgstr "Berkas tidak dapat diperiksa. Coba lagi."

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:61
#, python-format
msgid "%(value)s is not a Faktur Pajak number (17 digits)."
msgstr "%(value)s bukan nomor Faktur Pajak (17 digit)."

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:68
#, python-format
msgid "Status %(status)s in Coretax: not recorded."
msgstr "Status %(status)s di Coretax: tidak dicatat."

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:75
msgid "Faktur Pajak numbers (sales)"
msgstr "Nomor Faktur Pajak (penjualan)"

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:77
msgid ""
"Coretax's list of output fakturs (Pajak Keluaran), downloaded after the faktur file was uploaded "
"and approved: each sales invoice takes its Faktur Pajak number. The faktur's reference is the "
"invoice number; without it, the buyer's NPWP, the date and the PPN find the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Daftar faktur keluaran Coretax (Pajak Keluaran), diunduh setelah berkas faktur diunggah dan "
"disetujui: setiap faktur penjualan mendapat nomor Faktur Pajaknya. Referensi faktur adalah nomor "
"faktur penjualan; tanpa referensi, faktur dicari dari NPWP pembeli, tanggal, dan PPN."

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:106 apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:173
msgid "faktur date"
msgstr "tanggal faktur"

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:121
msgid "No sales invoice found for this faktur (it may have been made in Coretax directly)."
msgstr "Tidak ada faktur penjualan untuk Faktur Pajak ini (mungkin dibuat langsung di Coretax)."

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:123 apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:179
#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:308
msgid "Already recorded."
msgstr "Sudah dicatat."

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:125
#, python-format
msgid "The invoice already has Faktur Pajak %(number)s: check which one is valid."
msgstr "Faktur penjualan sudah memiliki Faktur Pajak %(number)s: periksa mana yang berlaku."

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:129
#, python-format
msgid "The faktur's PPN %(faktur)s differs from the invoice's %(invoice)s: not recorded."
msgstr "PPN Faktur Pajak %(faktur)s berbeda dari PPN faktur penjualan %(invoice)s: tidak dicatat."

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:138
msgid "Input VAT fakturs (purchases)"
msgstr "Faktur PPN masukan (pembelian)"

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:140
msgid ""
"Coretax's list of input fakturs (Pajak Masukan): each matching purchase bill (same supplier NPWP "
"and PPN, dated within a month of the faktur) takes its Faktur Pajak number. The check lists the "
"fakturs without a bill and the bills of those months still without a faktur."
msgstr ""
"Daftar faktur masukan Coretax (Pajak Masukan): setiap tagihan pembelian yang cocok (NPWP pemasok "
"dan PPN sama, bertanggal dalam sebulan dari faktur) mendapat nomor Faktur Pajaknya. Pemeriksaan "
"menampilkan faktur tanpa tagihan dan tagihan pada bulan-bulan itu yang belum memiliki faktur."

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:186
msgid "No purchase bill with this supplier and PPN: record the bill to credit this input VAT."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada tagihan pembelian dengan pemasok dan PPN ini: catat tagihannya agar PPN masukan ini "
"dapat dikreditkan."

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:190
#, python-format
msgid "Its tax base %(faktur)s differs from the bill's %(bill)s."
msgstr "DPP-nya %(faktur)s berbeda dari DPP tagihan %(bill)s."

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:200
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bill %(number)s from %(supplier)s (%(date)s) has no faktur in Coretax yet: its input VAT can't be "
"credited without one."
msgstr ""
"Tagihan %(number)s dari %(supplier)s (%(date)s) belum memiliki faktur di Coretax: PPN masukannya "
"tidak dapat dikreditkan tanpa faktur."

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:216
#, python-format
msgid "The tax period %(month)s %(year)s can't be read."
msgstr "Masa pajak %(month)s %(year)s tidak terbaca."

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:223
msgid "Bukti potong numbers"
msgstr "Nomor bukti potong"

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:225
msgid ""
"Coretax's list of bukti potong (eBupot) issued for the files uploaded from here: the supplier "
"payments, payslips and self-deposited PPh take their numbers. Payments and self deposits are found"
" by the document number on the bukti potong (the bill's number) and the recipient's NPWP/NIK, "
"payslips by the recipient and the tax period."
msgstr ""
"Daftar bukti potong (eBupot) Coretax untuk berkas yang diunggah dari sini: pembayaran kepada "
"pemasok, slip gaji, dan PPh yang disetor sendiri mendapat nomornya. Pembayaran dan setoran sendiri"
" dicari dari nomor dokumen pada bukti potong (nomor tagihan) dan NPWP/NIK penerima, slip gaji dari"
" penerima dan masa pajaknya."

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:259
msgid "gross income"
msgstr "penghasilan bruto"

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:310
#, python-format
msgid "It already has bukti potong %(number)s."
msgstr "Sudah memiliki bukti potong %(number)s."

#: apps/uploads/importers/coretax.py:313
msgid "No payment, payslip or self deposit found for this bukti potong."
msgstr "Tidak ada pembayaran, slip gaji, atau setoran sendiri untuk bukti potong ini."

#: apps/uploads/importers/master.py:42
#, python-format
msgid "Kelurahan/desa code: %(value)s is not a 10-digit Kemendagri code such as 36.03.22.2008."
msgstr "Kode kelurahan/desa: %(value)s bukan kode Kemendagri 10 digit seperti 36.03.22.2008."

#: apps/uploads/importers/master.py:51
msgid ""
"Customers and suppliers with their NPWP and address. The kelurahan/desa is its Kemendagri code, or"
" found from the postcode when only one has it; the postcode is checked against it."
msgstr ""
"Pelanggan dan pemasok dengan NPWP dan alamatnya. Kelurahan/desa diisi kode Kemendagri, atau dicari"
" dari kode pos bila hanya satu kelurahan/desa yang memilikinya; kode pos dicocokkan dengannya."

#: apps/uploads/importers/master.py:103
#, python-format
msgid "Already in your contacts as %(name)s."
msgstr "Sudah ada di kontak Anda sebagai %(name)s."

#: apps/uploads/importers/master.py:130
msgid ""
"Goods and services with their prices. Accounts are given by their code and the PPN by the name of "
"one of your PPN rates; left empty, the item uses the defaults of the invoice lines."
msgstr ""
"Barang dan jasa beserta harganya. Akun diisi kodenya dan PPN diisi nama salah satu tarif PPN Anda;"
" bila kosong, barang memakai bawaan baris faktur."

#: apps/uploads/importers/master.py:162
#, python-format
msgid "%(column)s: there is no account %(code)s."
msgstr "%(column)s: tidak ada akun %(code)s."

#: apps/uploads/importers/master.py:173
#, python-format
msgid "PPN rate: there is no active rate named %(name)s."
msgstr "Tarif PPN: tidak ada tarif aktif bernama %(name)s."

#: apps/uploads/importers/master.py:181
#, python-format
msgid "Already in your items as %(item)s."
msgstr "Sudah ada di daftar barang Anda sebagai %(item)s."

#: apps/uploads/importers/master.py:189
msgid "purchase account"
msgstr "akun pembelian"

#: apps/uploads/importers/master.py:209
msgid ""
"Accounts to add to the chart of accounts, e.g. one per bank account. The category is one of the "
"SAK EMKM groups (as named on the account page, in either language); accounts whose code is already"
" used are left as they are."
msgstr ""
"Akun yang ditambahkan ke bagan akun, mis. satu per rekening bank. Kategorinya salah satu kelompok "
"SAK EMKM (seperti di halaman akun, dalam bahasa mana pun); akun yang kodenya sudah dipakai "
"dibiarkan apa adanya."

#: apps/uploads/importers/master.py:232
#, python-format
msgid "The code is already used by %(account)s."
msgstr "Kode tersebut sudah dipakai oleh %(account)s."

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:60
#, python-format
msgid "Several contacts are named %(name)s: give the NPWP instead."
msgstr "Ada beberapa kontak bernama %(name)s: isi NPWP-nya."

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:61
msgid "customer"
msgstr "pelanggan"

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:61
msgid "supplier"
msgstr "pemasok"

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:62
#, python-format
msgid "There is no %(what)s %(name)s: add it to the contacts first (or upload the contacts)."
msgstr "Tidak ada %(what)s %(name)s: tambahkan ke kontak dulu (atau unggah kontaknya)."

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:67
msgid "Balances as at"
msgstr "Saldo per"

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:68
msgid "The last day in the earlier books, e.g. 31 December 2025: the entry is posted on it."
msgstr ""
"Hari terakhir pembukuan sebelumnya, mis. 31 Desember 2025: jurnal diposting pada tanggal itu."

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:77
msgid ""
"The trial balance of the earlier books on their last day, one row per account. A receivable or "
"payable gives its customer or supplier (name or NPWP), document number and due date, one row per "
"document still open; the inventory of a tracked item gives the item code and quantity. Fixed "
"assets are in the balances by their cost and accumulated depreciation; add them to the register "
"with the fixed assets file."
msgstr ""
"Neraca saldo pembukuan sebelumnya pada hari terakhirnya, satu baris per akun. Piutang atau utang "
"diisi pelanggan atau pemasoknya (nama atau NPWP), nomor dokumen, dan tanggal jatuh tempo, satu "
"baris per dokumen yang masih terbuka; persediaan barang yang stoknya dilacak diisi kode barang dan"
" kuantitasnya. Aset tetap masuk dalam saldo dengan harga perolehan dan akumulasi penyusutannya; "
"daftarkan ke register dengan berkas aset tetap."

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:117
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Opening balances come before the first transaction recorded here, but entry %(number)s is dated "
"%(date)s. Choose an earlier date, or record the earlier transactions as journals."
msgstr ""
"Saldo awal harus sebelum transaksi pertama yang dicatat di sini, tetapi jurnal %(number)s "
"bertanggal %(date)s. Pilih tanggal yang lebih awal, atau catat transaksi sebelumnya sebagai "
"jurnal."

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:131
msgid "Enter the balance in either the debit or the credit column."
msgstr "Isi saldo pada kolom debet atau kolom kredit saja."

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:138
#, python-format
msgid "There is no active account %(code)s."
msgstr "Tidak ada akun aktif %(code)s."

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:154
msgid ""
"A customer's credit balance (an advance) goes on a liability account, e.g. Pendapatan Diterima di "
"Muka."
msgstr ""
"Saldo kredit pelanggan (uang muka) dicatat pada akun liabilitas, mis. Pendapatan Diterima di Muka."

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:156
msgid ""
"A debit balance with a supplier (an advance paid) goes on an asset account, e.g. Uang Muka "
"Pembelian."
msgstr ""
"Saldo debet pada pemasok (uang muka yang dibayar) dicatat pada akun aset, mis. Uang Muka "
"Pembelian."

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:159
msgid "Give the customer or supplier of each receivable or payable, one row per open document."
msgstr ""
"Isi pelanggan atau pemasok untuk setiap piutang atau utang, satu baris per dokumen yang masih "
"terbuka."

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:175
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Account %(account)s holds tracked stock: give the code of the item and its quantity, one row per "
"item."
msgstr ""
"Akun %(account)s berisi persediaan yang dilacak: isi kode barang dan kuantitasnya, satu baris per "
"barang."

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:178
msgid "Stock can't have a credit balance."
msgstr "Persediaan tidak boleh bersaldo kredit."

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:184
msgid "Enter the quantity on hand."
msgstr "Isi kuantitas persediaan yang ada."

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:196
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The balances don't balance: debits %(debit)s, credits %(credit)s. A trial balance has as much on "
"each side."
msgstr ""
"Saldo tidak seimbang: debet %(debit)s, kredit %(credit)s. Neraca saldo memiliki jumlah yang sama "
"di kedua sisi."

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:217
msgid ""
"The register of assets already in the opening balances (registering posts nothing). Give the "
"accounts by code, the useful life in months and the month through which the earlier books "
"depreciated them; depreciation goes on from the next month, without a residual value."
msgstr ""
"Register aset yang sudah ada dalam saldo awal (pendaftaran tidak memposting apa pun). Isi akun "
"dengan kodenya, umur manfaat dalam bulan, dan bulan terakhir yang sudah disusutkan pembukuan "
"sebelumnya; penyusutan berlanjut mulai bulan berikutnya, tanpa nilai residu."

#: apps/uploads/importers/opening.py:252
msgid "depreciated through"
msgstr "disusutkan sampai"

#: apps/uploads/models.py:18
msgid "file"
msgstr "berkas"

#: apps/uploads/models.py:19
msgid "SHA-256"
msgstr "SHA-256"

#: apps/uploads/models.py:20
msgid "rows"
msgstr "baris"

#: apps/uploads/models.py:21
msgid "rows applied"
msgstr "baris diterapkan"

#: apps/uploads/models.py:22
