#: templates/reports/notes.html:23
msgid "Statement of compliance"
msgstr "Pernyataan kepatuhan"

#: templates/reports/notes.html:24
msgid ""
"These financial statements have been prepared in accordance with the Financial Accounting "
"Standards for Micro, Small and Medium Entities (SAK EMKM)."
msgstr ""
"Laporan keuangan ini disusun sesuai dengan Standar Akuntansi Keuangan Entitas Mikro, Kecil, dan "
"Menengah (SAK EMKM)."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:25
msgid "Basis of preparation"
msgstr "Dasar penyusunan"

#: templates/reports/notes.html:26
msgid ""
"The financial statements are prepared on the accrual basis and at historical cost, on the "
"assumption that the business is a going concern. The business is accounted for separately from its"
" owners: their personal transactions are not recorded."
msgstr ""
"Laporan keuangan disusun dengan dasar akrual dan biaya historis, dengan asumsi usaha akan terus "
"berlanjut (kelangsungan usaha). Usaha dicatat terpisah dari pemiliknya: transaksi pribadi pemilik "
"tidak dicatat."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:27
msgid "Presentation currency"
msgstr "Mata uang penyajian"

#: templates/reports/notes.html:28
msgid ""
"The financial statements are presented in Rupiah, the currency of the business's main economic "
"environment."
msgstr "Laporan keuangan disajikan dalam Rupiah, mata uang lingkungan ekonomi utama usaha."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:29
msgid "Revenue and expenses"
msgstr "Pendapatan dan beban"

#: templates/reports/notes.html:30
msgid ""
"Revenue from the sale of goods and services is recognised when the invoice is issued, that is when"
" the goods have been delivered or the services rendered, at the gross amount excluding PPN. "
"Payments received before the goods or services are delivered are a liability (revenue received in "
"advance) until then. Revenue and costs of construction contracts are recognised as billed. "
"Interest and dividends, including distributions from joint ventures, are recognised when received;"
" rent and royalties received in advance are recognised straight-line over the contract. Grants are"
" income when received, unless they are in substance a contribution of capital by the owner. "
"Expenses are recognised when they are incurred, regardless of when they are paid: rent and other "
"expenses paid in advance are presented as prepaid expenses and expensed straight-line over the "
"period they cover. Sales and purchase returns are recorded in the period of the return."
msgstr ""
"Pendapatan dari penjualan barang dan jasa diakui saat faktur diterbitkan, yaitu saat barang telah "
"diserahkan atau jasa telah diberikan, sebesar jumlah bruto tanpa PPN. Pembayaran yang diterima "
"sebelum barang atau jasa diserahkan merupakan liabilitas (pendapatan diterima di muka) sampai saat"
" itu. Pendapatan dan biaya kontrak konstruksi diakui sebesar jumlah tagihan. Pendapatan bunga dan "
"dividen, termasuk pembagian dari ventura bersama, diakui saat diterima; sewa dan royalti yang "
"diterima di muka diakui dengan metode garis lurus selama kontrak. Hibah diakui sebagai penghasilan"
" saat diterima, kecuali secara substansi merupakan kontribusi modal dari pemilik. Beban diakui "
"saat terjadi, tanpa memandang kapan dibayar: sewa dan beban lain yang dibayar di muka disajikan "
"sebagai beban dibayar di muka dan dibebankan dengan metode garis lurus selama periode yang "
"ditanggungnya. Retur penjualan dan pembelian dicatat pada periode terjadinya retur."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:32
msgid ""
"Trade receivables are stated at the amount invoiced, less what has been received. As SAK EMKM "
"provides (8.10), no allowance for doubtful debts is made; a receivable that is unlikely to be "
"collected is written off and the loss is recognised as an expense (8.11)."
msgstr ""
"Piutang usaha dinyatakan sebesar jumlah tagihan dikurangi yang telah diterima. Sesuai SAK EMKM "
"(8.10), tidak dibentuk penyisihan piutang tak tertagih; piutang yang kemungkinan besar tidak dapat"
" ditagih dihapuskan dan kerugiannya diakui sebagai beban (8.11)."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:34
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Inventory is measured at cost: the purchase price and the other costs of bringing it to its "
"present location and condition. The cost of inventory sold is determined using the %(formula)s "
"formula. Stock is recorded perpetually: purchases are added to inventory, and the cost of goods "
"sold is recognised when each sale is invoiced. Goods bought without stock records are expensed "
"when purchased. Inventory that can no longer be sold for its cost is written down to its net "
"realisable value, and the loss is recognised in the period."
msgstr ""
"Persediaan diukur sebesar biaya perolehan: harga beli dan biaya lain untuk membawa persediaan ke "
"lokasi dan kondisi saat ini. Biaya persediaan yang terjual ditentukan dengan rumus %(formula)s. "
"Stok dicatat secara perpetual: pembelian menambah persediaan, dan harga pokok penjualan diakui "
"saat setiap penjualan difakturkan. Barang yang dibeli tanpa catatan stok dibebankan saat dibeli. "
"Persediaan yang tidak lagi dapat dijual seharga perolehannya diturunkan ke nilai realisasi neto, "
"dan kerugiannya diakui pada periode berjalan."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:36
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Fixed assets are measured at cost less accumulated depreciation; no impairment is recognised. Land"
" is not depreciated; other fixed assets are depreciated monthly over their useful lives using the "
"%(method)s method, without a residual value, from the month they are acquired and ready for use. "
"Repairs and maintenance are expensed. Changes in useful life or depreciation method are changes in"
" estimate, applied prospectively. When an asset is sold, the difference between the proceeds and "
"its book value is other income or expense; when it is given away or scrapped, its book value is an"
" other expense."
msgstr ""
"Aset tetap diukur sebesar biaya perolehan dikurangi akumulasi penyusutan; tidak diakui penurunan "
"nilai. Tanah tidak disusutkan; aset tetap lainnya disusutkan setiap bulan selama umur manfaatnya "
"dengan metode %(method)s, tanpa nilai residu, sejak bulan aset diperoleh dan siap digunakan. Biaya"
" perbaikan dan pemeliharaan dibebankan. Perubahan umur manfaat atau metode penyusutan merupakan "
"perubahan estimasi yang diterapkan secara prospektif. Jika aset dijual, selisih hasil penjualan "
"dengan nilai bukunya diakui sebagai pendapatan atau beban lain-lain; jika diserahkan kepada pihak "
"lain atau dimusnahkan, nilai bukunya diakui sebagai beban lain-lain."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:38
msgid ""
"Intangible assets acquired separately (e.g. software, licences, franchises) are measured at cost "
"less accumulated amortisation, amortised over their limited useful lives without a residual value;"
" no impairment is recognised. Intangible items generated internally, such as research, brands, "
"start-up costs, training and advertising, are expensed."
msgstr ""
"Aset takberwujud yang diperoleh secara terpisah (mis. perangkat lunak, lisensi, waralaba) diukur "
"sebesar biaya perolehan dikurangi akumulasi amortisasi, diamortisasi selama umur manfaatnya yang "
"terbatas tanpa nilai residu; tidak diakui penurunan nilai. Pos takberwujud yang dihasilkan secara "
"internal, seperti riset, merek, biaya perintisan, pelatihan, dan periklanan, dibebankan."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:40
msgid ""
"Investments in joint ventures are measured at cost and presented as assets; no impairment is "
"recognised."
msgstr ""
"Investasi pada ventura bersama diukur sebesar biaya perolehan dan disajikan sebagai aset; "
"penurunan nilai tidak diakui."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:41
msgid "Employee benefits"
msgstr "Imbalan kerja"

#: templates/reports/notes.html:42
msgid ""
"Salaries, allowances and the employer's BPJS contributions are expenses of the month in which the "
"employees earn them, at the undiscounted amount payable; severance is an expense when the "
"termination is decided. PPh 21 and PPh 26 withheld and BPJS contributions not yet paid are "
"presented as liabilities."
msgstr ""
"Gaji, tunjangan, dan iuran BPJS bagian pemberi kerja merupakan beban pada bulan pegawai "
"memperolehnya, sebesar jumlah tidak terdiskonto yang terutang; pesangon dibebankan saat pemutusan "
"hubungan kerja diputuskan. PPh 21 dan PPh 26 yang dipotong serta iuran BPJS yang belum dibayar "
"disajikan sebagai liabilitas."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:43
msgid "Liabilities"
msgstr "Liabilitas"

#: templates/reports/notes.html:44
msgid ""
"Liabilities are stated at the amount needed to settle them; loans at the amount borrowed less "
"repayments. Borrowing costs and the transaction costs of loans are expensed when incurred. "
"Provisions and contingent liabilities are not recognised; material ones are disclosed under "
"additional information."
msgstr ""
"Liabilitas dinyatakan sebesar jumlah yang harus dibayarkan; pinjaman sebesar jumlah pinjaman "
"dikurangi pembayaran pokok. Biaya pinjaman dan biaya transaksi pinjaman dibebankan saat terjadi. "
"Provisi dan liabilitas kontinjensi tidak diakui; yang material diungkapkan dalam informasi "
"tambahan."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:45
msgid "Foreign currency"
msgstr "Mata uang asing"

#: templates/reports/notes.html:46
msgid ""
"Transactions in a foreign currency are recorded in Rupiah at the spot rate on the date of the "
"transaction."
msgstr ""
"Transaksi dalam mata uang asing dicatat dalam Rupiah berdasarkan kurs tunai pada tanggal "
"transaksi."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:48
msgid ""
"Equity consists of paid-up share capital, additional paid-in capital (what shareholders paid above"
" the shares' nominal value) and retained earnings. Dividends reduce retained earnings when the "
"shareholders declare them."
msgstr ""
"Ekuitas terdiri atas modal saham yang disetor, tambahan modal disetor (yang dibayar pemegang saham"
" di atas nilai nominal saham) dan saldo laba. Dividen mengurangi saldo laba ketika diumumkan oleh "
"pemegang saham."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:49
msgid ""
"Equity consists of the members' principal and compulsory savings (simpanan pokok and simpanan "
"wajib), reserves and the retained surplus (sisa hasil usaha). Surplus distributed to members "
"reduces equity when the members' meeting decides it."
msgstr ""
"Ekuitas terdiri atas simpanan pokok dan simpanan wajib anggota, cadangan dan sisa hasil usaha "
"(SHU) yang belum dibagikan. SHU yang dibagikan kepada anggota mengurangi ekuitas ketika diputuskan"
" oleh rapat anggota."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:50
msgid ""
"Equity consists of the partners' capital and retained earnings. Amounts the partners withdraw for "
"their own use (prive) reduce equity."
msgstr ""
"Ekuitas terdiri atas modal sekutu dan saldo laba. Pengambilan oleh sekutu untuk keperluan pribadi "
"(prive) mengurangi ekuitas."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:51
msgid ""
"Equity consists of the owner's capital and retained earnings. Amounts the owner withdraws for "
"personal use (prive) reduce equity."
msgstr ""
"Ekuitas terdiri atas modal pemilik dan saldo laba. Pengambilan oleh pemilik untuk keperluan "
"pribadi (prive) mengurangi ekuitas."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:52
msgid "Accounting policies, estimates and errors"
msgstr "Kebijakan akuntansi, estimasi, dan kesalahan"

#: templates/reports/notes.html:53
msgid ""
"The policies above are applied consistently. Changes in estimates are applied prospectively; "
"errors of prior periods are corrected retrospectively, restating the comparative figures."
msgstr ""
"Kebijakan di atas diterapkan secara konsisten. Perubahan estimasi diterapkan secara prospektif; "
"kesalahan periode lalu dikoreksi secara retrospektif dengan menyajikan kembali angka komparatif."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:55
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Income tax is the final income tax for MSMEs under PP 55/2022, 0.5%% of gross turnover. It is "
"recognised as an expense in the month the turnover arises, and any amount not yet paid is "
"presented as a liability. Because the tax is final, no deferred tax is recognised."
msgstr ""
"Pajak penghasilan berupa PPh Final UMKM berdasarkan PP 55/2022, sebesar 0,5%% dari peredaran "
"bruto. Pajak diakui sebagai beban pada bulan peredaran bruto terjadi, dan jumlah yang belum "
"disetor disajikan sebagai liabilitas. Karena bersifat final, tidak ada pajak tangguhan yang "
"diakui."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:56
msgid ""
"Income tax expense is the tax payable for the period under the tax regulations. As SAK EMKM "
"provides, no deferred tax is recognised."
msgstr ""
"Beban pajak penghasilan adalah pajak terutang periode berjalan sesuai peraturan perpajakan. Sesuai"
" SAK EMKM, pajak tangguhan tidak diakui."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:57
msgid ""
"Income tax that customers withhold from their payments is presented as prepaid tax (PPh 22 and 23)"
" until it is credited, or settles part of the month's final income tax liability (PPh Final). "
"Income tax withheld from payments to suppliers (PPh 21, 23, 26 and 4(2)) is a liability until it "
"is deposited. Final income tax the business deposits itself on its own income (e.g. on rent) is an"
" expense of the month of that income. PPh 22 paid on imports is prepaid tax."
msgstr ""
"Pajak penghasilan yang dipotong pelanggan dari pembayarannya disajikan sebagai pajak dibayar di "
"muka (PPh 22 dan 23) sampai dikreditkan, atau melunasi sebagian utang PPh final bulan tersebut "
"(PPh Final). PPh yang dipotong dari pembayaran kepada pemasok (PPh 21, 23, 26 dan 4(2)) merupakan "
"liabilitas sampai disetor. PPh final yang disetor sendiri atas penghasilan entitas (mis. atas "
"sewa) merupakan beban bulan penghasilan tersebut. PPh 22 yang dibayar atas impor merupakan pajak "
"dibayar di muka."

#: templates/reports/notes.html:58
msgid "Value added tax (PPN)"
msgstr "Pajak Pertambahan Nilai (PPN)"

#: templates/reports/notes.html:59
#, python-format
msgid ""
"As a VAT-registered business (PKP), PPN charged to customers and PPN paid to suppliers is not "
"revenue or expense. The balances are presented as a liability (output VAT) and an asset (input "
"VAT). PPN that customers appointed as VAT collectors withhold and deposit settles the output VAT; "
"PPN on deliveries under a facility (not collected or exempt) is not charged. PPnBM on luxury goods"
" sold is a liability; PPnBM paid on purchases is part of their cost. PPN paid at customs on "
"imports is input VAT; exports bear PPN at 0%%."
msgstr ""
"Sebagai Pengusaha Kena Pajak (PKP), PPN yang dipungut dari pelanggan dan PPN yang dibayar kepada "
"pemasok bukan pendapatan atau beban. Saldonya disajikan sebagai liabilitas (PPN keluaran) dan aset"
" (PPN masukan). PPN yang dipungut dan disetor oleh pelanggan yang ditunjuk sebagai pemungut PPN "
"melunasi PPN keluaran; PPN atas penyerahan dengan fasilitas (tidak dipungut atau dibebaskan) tidak"
" ditagih. PPnBM atas penjualan barang mewah merupakan liabilitas; PPnBM yang dibayar atas "
"pembelian menjadi bagian dari harga perolehannya. PPN yang dibayar di pabean atas impor merupakan "
"PPN masukan; ekspor dikenai PPN 0%%."

