#: templates/taxes/pph_final.html:73
msgid ""
"Legal basis: PP 55/2022. Payment is due by the 15th of the following month (PMK 81/2024), or the "
"next working day when that is a weekend or public holiday. Gross turnover is calculated from "
"posted operating revenue accounts."
msgstr ""
"Dasar hukum: PP 55/2022. Setoran paling lambat tanggal 15 bulan berikutnya (PMK 81/2024), atau "
"hari kerja berikutnya bila jatuh pada hari libur atau akhir pekan. Peredaran bruto dihitung dari "
"akun Pendapatan Usaha yang telah diposting."

#: templates/taxes/pph_final.html:74
msgid ""
"Under SAK EMKM's accrual basis, each month's PPh Final is an expense of that month: record it "
"after the month ends (it is posted on the last day of the month as a liability), and the payment "
"settles the liability. Recording a payment also records a missing expense."
msgstr ""
"Dengan dasar akrual SAK EMKM, PPh Final setiap bulan merupakan beban bulan itu: catat setelah "
"bulan berakhir (dijurnal pada hari terakhir bulan sebagai utang), lalu setoran melunasi utang "
"tersebut. Mencatat setoran juga mencatat beban yang belum ada."

#: templates/taxes/pph_final.html:75
msgid ""
"PPh Final that buyers withheld from your receipts (with your Surat Keterangan PP 55) is deposited "
"by them: it counts towards the month of the receipt, and you deposit only the rest."
msgstr ""
"PPh Final yang dipotong pembeli dari penerimaan Anda (dengan Surat Keterangan PP 55 Anda) disetor "
"oleh mereka: diperhitungkan pada bulan penerimaan, dan Anda hanya menyetor sisanya."

#: templates/taxes/pph_final.html:79
msgid "Record PPh Final payment"
msgstr "Catat Setoran PPh Final"

#: templates/taxes/self_deposits.html:6
#, python-format
msgid "Self-deposited final PPh %(year)s"
msgstr "PPh final disetor sendiri %(year)s"

#: templates/taxes/self_deposits.html:17
msgid "Cancel this self-deposit?"
msgstr "Batalkan setoran sendiri ini?"

#: templates/taxes/self_deposits.html:18
msgid "No self-deposited tax this year."
msgstr "Belum ada pajak yang disetor sendiri tahun ini."

#: templates/taxes/self_deposits.html:22
msgid "Record a self-deposit"
msgstr "Catat setoran sendiri"

#: templates/taxes/self_deposits.html:27
#, python-format
msgid ""
"When your customer doesn't withhold the final PPh on your income (e.g. a tenant who isn't a "
"withholding agent, 10%% on rent), you deposit it yourself by the 15th of the next month. It is an "
"expense of the month of the income; its deposit settles it. Each one is reported with a BPSP, in "
"the month's eBupot files (Withheld income tax)."
msgstr ""
"Jika pelanggan tidak memotong PPh final atas penghasilan Anda (mis. penyewa yang bukan pemotong "
"pajak, 10%% atas sewa), Anda menyetorkannya sendiri paling lambat tanggal 15 bulan berikutnya. PPh"
" tersebut menjadi beban bulan penghasilannya; setorannya melunasinya. Masing-masing dilaporkan "
"dengan BPSP, dalam berkas eBupot bulan itu (PPh yang dipotong)."

#: templates/taxes/taxrate_form.html:3 templates/taxes/taxrate_form.html:5
