msgstr "Catat setoran"

#: templates/taxes/withholding.html:23
msgid "No income tax was withheld this year. Record it when paying a bill or running payroll."
msgstr ""
"Belum ada PPh yang dipotong tahun ini. Catat saat membayar tagihan atau menjalankan penggajian."

#: templates/taxes/withholding.html:25
msgid ""
"When you pay a supplier for services (PPh 23), rent of land or buildings (PPh 4(2)) or an "
"individual's fee (PPh 21), and when you pay salaries (PPh 21, or PPh 26 for non-residents), you "
"withhold the tax, deposit it by the 15th of the next month (the next working day when that is a "
"weekend or public holiday) and give a bukti potong from Coretax eBupot. Withholding in a month "
"that is already deposited is refused: cancel the deposit first."
msgstr ""
"Saat membayar pemasok untuk jasa (PPh 23), sewa tanah atau bangunan (PPh 4(2)) atau imbalan orang "
"pribadi (PPh 21), dan saat membayar gaji (PPh 21, atau PPh 26 untuk WPLN), Anda memotong pajaknya,"
" menyetorkannya paling lambat tanggal 15 bulan berikutnya (hari kerja berikutnya bila jatuh pada "
"hari libur atau akhir pekan), dan memberikan bukti potong dari Coretax eBupot. Pemotongan pada "
"bulan yang sudah disetor ditolak: batalkan setorannya terlebih dahulu."

#: templates/taxes/withholding_month.html:3 templates/taxes/withholding_month.html:6
